This repository includes files adapted from NavierStokesAndEuler
(https://github.com/openai/NavierStokesAndEuler), developed by OpenAI and licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The adapted files, taken from commit
f9e8bc5b38b6e212696e8a30e3e91517af887bbd, are

  NonUniqueEuler/Vendor/ODE/GlobalPicard.lean
      from Euler/EulerProof.lean (lines 18141-18310)
  NonUniqueEuler/Vendor/Flow/BoundedLipschitzFlow.lean
      from Euler/BoundedLipschitzFlow.lean (lines 1-125) and
      Euler/BoundedFlowContinuity.lean (lines 1-98)

The modifications (namespaces, imports, module documentation, and the cross-reference from
the second file to the first) are stated in the header of each file.

The build depends on Lean 4 and on Mathlib
(https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4, Apache License, Version 2.0), which
are fetched at build time and are not included in this repository.
